{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "09d728c4f036cc081f158f15e1800369f7cf8bee65ba5cf81b3dc94c06ccf40d", "ja": "きっとみんなで", "zh": "大家一定能一起", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "aa8458090e16f5d67bcd42108ac0cf958df53ae11581c2391cc8b6ae7e96a1b5", "ja": "ライブを終えた未来達のところに、劇場の仲\n間達がやってくる。ステージで見せたありが\nとうの気持ちと笑顔は、みんなにも伝わって\nいた。プロデューサーは、いつまでも一緒に\n頑張ろう、と告げるのだった。", "zh": "演出结束后，未来她们身边来了剧场的伙伴们。  \n在舞台上展现的感谢之情与笑容，也传达给了大家。  \n制作人告诉她们，要永远一起努力下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aebee0de0270f8772dc8a83f785cfeafffc26132ea005e4cca19c6e663482284", "ja": "（PRライブのステージは、大きな歓声に包まれながら\n幕を下ろした。さて、俺は撤収の準備を……）", "zh": "（PR演出的舞台在一片热烈的欢呼声中落下帷幕。好了，我去准备收场工作……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "f9f9c85db02b39510f62cc7ded4deb6992dbb9060f9544bafe18007da4239cb5", "ja": "{$P$}さーん！\nあのっ、あのっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生——！\n那个，那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "e6f81cab8b769a2df6531e9514b1c2b628a2a32a2f39e4948cb99268219dcf83", "ja": "お客さんの顔が、みんなキラキラしてました！\n笑顔がいっぱいで、私まで楽しくなっちゃいました！", "zh": "客人们的脸上，全都闪闪发光！\n大家的笑容特别多，连我也变得开心起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fb2a21f9954ce2f7e7a1803fe95f586063f2f12903cf7512a5932b158f557688", "ja": "お疲れさま、未来。\nステージから楽しい気持ちが伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，未来。\n从舞台上传来了快乐的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "e77201fdaa40a36c056ca0f16ae4f3b398511b6814b154f12e854b995a490663", "ja": "ちょっと未来！\nもう、いきなり走り出したら危ないでしょ？", "zh": "未来，等等！\n真是的，突然跑起来很危险的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "bd55d6afa2d797345dfa9b14a78e241235cd5973cd8552718169f174913e7768", "ja": "ごめんね静香ちゃん！　{$P$}さんを\n見つけちゃったから、つい……。でへへ～。", "zh": "对不起，静香！因为发现了{$P$}先生，一不小心就……嘿嘿～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "86c538b6deccfdd11d26f6ffa5bb19299faafd513edc4c18453e143d13ce1ebf", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん！\nわたし達のステージ、どうでしたか？", "zh": "对了对了，{$P$}先生！\n我们的舞台怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fca7980bdaabfcb22897f920839af17f7b456061531bfc4ddeb603fb912146e8", "ja": "すごくよかったよ！\n客席のみんなも、夢中になってくれてたな。", "zh": "真的很棒！\n观众们也都看得入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "daafbb0ab8da2424170e5fb38bd1d53e8f162684e3fa12e48be0bb9bba95197e", "ja": "やっぱりそうですよねー！　最後のとこ、\nお客さんも一緒に歌ってくれて、うれしかったな～♪", "zh": "果然是这样呢——！最后那一段，客人们也一起唱了，我好开心啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "91e21792a170e64eb4202cc8055293aad06ab26f7f1217c1bd1aa5ff0f8e8d29", "ja": "そうね。会場全体にみんなの声が響き渡って……\nなんだか感動しちゃった。", "zh": "是啊。大家的歌声响彻整个会场……\n不知怎么的，真的让我感动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1010_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "47ae9060acd8633b8b97a916e2269bc947cbdb1e469a2069e43783f3d5e1b11e", "ja": "みんな、お疲れー！　本番はビシッと揃ってたじゃん！\nダンスも歌もカンペキだったよ！", "zh": "大家，辛苦啦——！正式演出时动作整齐划一，超帅的嘛！\n不管是跳舞还是唱歌，都无可挑剔哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "9237432415c67abbee8a375023c2e024ac8b51220f9c37232723069fa70c1f45", "ja": "それに、笑顔もとってもステキでした！\nお客さんも楽しそうだったし……すごいです♪", "zh": "而且，大家的笑容也特别棒！客人们看起来也很开心……真厉害♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "adc90635559bfc0f07cc1da430b799c0061253450287ab861a695d11779b5ad3", "ja": "ホントそれだよね！　3人とも、めっちゃキラキラして\nさ～。歌も気持ちこもってて、なんか……ううう～！", "zh": "真的就是这样！3个人全都闪闪发光的～。歌里也饱含感情，让人……呜呜呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "f1265a8866c50ac2401133817f29a486777f64b67d6e77a95564383e072d8398", "ja": "わわっ！　め、恵美ちゃん泣かないで～！\nええっと、タオルタオル～！", "zh": "哇哇！惠美，别哭啊～！\n呃，毛巾毛巾～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "95107a816c5170655cf6d25a61672514da6d434130380d09767ec646ab61acfb", "ja": "歩さん、恵美さん、来てくれてありがとうございます。\nとっても心強かったです！　……星梨花も、本当に！", "zh": "步、惠美，谢谢你们能来。\n真的让我安心多了！……星梨花也是，真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8bd4b4d9e0db70e342b6c05e7e48082b05d682dd9c7d8bde87cb55ca0c6b249b", "ja": "じつはアタシもうるっと来てたんだけど、\n恵美が先に泣くもんだから、泣くに泣けなくてさ～！", "zh": "其实我也差点哭出来了，可惠美先哭了，我想哭也哭不出来啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "d0caaaae193c07a978562938992fd18e51067e661fab7ed51a81a28507892bc9", "ja": "ぐすっ……歩だって似たようなもんだったでしょ！\nハンカチしぼってたじゃん！　知ってんだからね！", "zh": "呜呜……步不也差不多嘛！你都把手帕拧得湿淋淋的了！我可是知道的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a6bea0564f28874ee1cf255d1fbebe471296060c45e9b0e7202a97638ee01af6", "ja": "みんなのこと、ステージからも見えてたんですよ～。\n星梨花ちゃんもノリノリだったよね♪", "zh": "我在舞台上也能看见大家哦～。\n星梨花也很起劲呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "2ecb8e3a2db25c8274706bc8edfdd6e830aa371e1a9e6a5d20d30ec65c43d21b", "ja": "は、はい、コンサートライトを振ってました！　でも、\n見えちゃってたなんて……ちょっと恥ずかしいです。", "zh": "是、是的，我一直在挥舞着演唱会灯！不过，没想到居然被看到了……有点不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b8e45ea5df91562b2713455ae41704ce4ef6d76660c7828f2fa9fa11ec051f7", "ja": "でも、みんなが応援してくれてるのが見えて、\nすっごく嬉しかったよ！", "zh": "不过，能看到大家都在为我加油，我真的特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "e5058b06b74747870a81a7aa25c21e1827a02f82a596ca4c59085620f59cac1a", "ja": "なんか劇場のみんなと一緒に歌ってる気持ちに\nなれたっていうか……そんな感じで！", "zh": "总觉得就像和剧场的大家一起唱歌一样……大概就是这种感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4005bfea35be1a91027994d1e5bd505ad29d055942be97981b07c65157e4df5c", "ja": "ああ、きっと未来達は、劇場のみんなの想いも一緒に、\nこの曲に乗せて届けてくれたんだと思うよ。", "zh": "啊，我觉得未来她们一定也把剧场大家的心意，一起融入这首歌传达出去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "5bfb9ca5d9a75a1c87682b0d0c1c18f91d57e35952d234fe5fcebd0588ac8d44", "ja": "え、私達、そんなこと出来てました？　わぁ……！\nホントにできてたら嬉しいです！　でへへ♪", "zh": "诶，我们真的做到那种事了吗？哇……！\n如果真的做到了，我会很开心的！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "0c33d777d844e2d4d2b29293c3deb04efb0bc44b7dfc0d6c5827e8a6ba602b62", "ja": "とにかく、未来、静香、翼。\n今日は劇場代表として、本当にお疲れさま。", "zh": "总之，未来、静香、翼。\n今天作为剧场代表，真的辛苦你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c90eced8cd178261edd35f87372fda1e14f4ae4338e0d70ca21afc08f7448bef", "ja": "ここはもちろん劇場じゃない。でも、どこに行っても、\n何人で歌うとしても、お前たちは劇場のアイドルだ。", "zh": "这里当然不是剧场。不过，无论去到哪里，\n无论几个人一起唱歌，你们都是剧场的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "940a9789d642639424c49df647b03fa3628ef6d6414fba497d752624a08dc801", "ja": "そう、これからも、アイドルだ！\nいつまでも、なんどでも。……一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "没错，今后也要一直当偶像！\n无论何时，无论多少次……我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1030_p", "source_sha256": "fde024c4dcc19c1686eddf38c47700a6aa09f8b20ecafdb609399dc7503ea9b3", "ja": "（アイドル達の輝きが、笑顔の輪を広げていく。\nみんなのおかげで、最高のステージになったな！）", "zh": "（偶像们的光芒不断扩大着笑容的圈子。\n多亏了大家，终于成了最棒的舞台啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "57f7e8d8687784b1c95167be4ab5e92b2393c7c68e91f6e9b1998b29ad2ada5b", "ja": "（プロデューサーとして、一番近くで、その輝きを\n見守っていこう。これまでも、これからも！）", "zh": "（作为制作人，就在最近的地方守望着那份光芒。不论过去，还是今后！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
